# Not committed, and deliberately so: this is a 10 MB working cache. A cold run costs
# roughly 120 model calls and about ten minutes, well inside the assignment's 30-minute
# budget, and shipping the cache would let the report be reproduced without the pipeline
# ever running — which is the opposite of what should be demonstrable.
